# Site canonical URL. Drives sitemap.xml, robots.txt, canonical and og:url
# meta, AND search engine indexability:
#
#   * Set to "https://carebond.ch" (or "https://www.carebond.ch") in
#     production. next.config.ts will allow indexing.
#   * Any other value (including blank, vercel.app URLs, preview deploys,
#     local dev) → next.config.ts emits X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
#     on every route. Default is intentionally restrictive — forgetting
#     to set this should never expose a preview to Google.
#
# For the active Vercel preview, set this in Vercel project Environment
# Variables to the preview alias (e.g. https://carebond-website.vercel.app)
# so sitemap and canonical tags emit the right host while still being
# noindexed.
#
# Local SEO 100 measurement protocol (Phase 1A commit 6 hardening pass):
#   1. cp .env.local .env.local.bak
#   2. Set NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000 in .env.local
#   3. Add "http://localhost:3000" to PRODUCTION_INDEX_URLS in
#      next.config.ts (next to carebond.ch entries) — temp only.
#   4. npm run build && npm run start
#   5. npx lighthouse http://localhost:3000/fr --quiet \
#        --chrome-flags="--headless=new" --output=json --output-path=.lh.json
#   6. Confirm SEO 100 (canonical aligned with served host + noindex off)
#   7. Revert next.config.ts (remove localhost from allowlist)
#   8. mv .env.local.bak .env.local
#   9. Confirm git status clean — neither file should appear in changes.
#
# Why this protocol exists:
#   Lighthouse penalizes "canonical points to another hreflang location"
#   when the served host differs from the canonical URL. Preview deploys
#   serve from carebond-website.vercel.app but canonicalize to
#   carebond.ch (correct for the future production domain). On the
#   preview, this yields SEO 92 as a known false positive; on production
#   with carebond.ch live, the score normalizes to 100. The protocol
#   above lets us verify the 100 ceiling exists pre-production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# Resend (Phase 1D — contact form)
RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_FORM_TO_EMAIL=contact@carebond.ch
CONTACT_FORM_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@carebond.ch

# Cloudflare Turnstile anti-spam (Phase 1D)
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=

# Plausible privacy-first analytics (Phase 3G)
NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=carebond.ch
NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_API_HOST=https://plausible.io

# Cal.com demo booking embed (Phase 1B / contact page)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CALCOM_USERNAME=carebond
